I have a set of eight questions, none of which I've added yet, of the form "lo 
crane cu <farna> lo trixe .i lo _____ jamfu cu <mlana>" where <farna> is one 
of berti, stuna, snanu, or stici, <mlana> is pritu or zunle, and the choices 
are ne'u, vu'a, be'a, and du'a. Is there a way to make the test contain at 
most one of these, or do we just add enough questions that the question pool 
is eight times the size of the test?

Pierre
